        "note": "Training + field water tubes. IMPORTANT: AWD's headline saving in the literature is in water APPLIED - percolation and seepage - not in evapotranspiration. In the closed, high-reuse Delta, percolation is largely recovered downstream, so we deliberately exclude it and count ONLY the evaporation component: removing the free water surface for part of the season. Hence 10%, not the 25-30% quoted for total water application."
      },
